- 1 Reinforcement (CTF: 20s Respawn)
- Assemble (1) - Respawns on characters with Rally

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

^2Strengths^7: Can fight at most all ranges.
^1Weaknesses^7: Not especially strong at any particular range."